<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-12T13:00:27.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:00:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran missiles and ground forces have struck Haitian gang hideouts, destroying the headquarters of the 400-member Mawozo gang and killing about 20 gang members. Haitian Prime Minister praised President Bukele after the joint strike on the alleged home of a gang leader, and Haitian officials are traveling to El Salvador to discuss the future of the Salvadoran offensive. The United Nations reported that kidnappings in Port-au-Prince rose in the third quarter. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168782&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBiNjUwQTJKX1R1WDdkbWJ5VTBqN25xNnFiQV9XVHBKaHh0TjZwRk11UUFUeTltakRsWVV4TlFicVZHUjBTVGVsbjctVHRldnZNSHA4SElEVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOWW44R3FKeFZQS2k3NzBHUWRDZ04weGFlMTZnR1JwYXVJeVRIOHV1VGdxc1hwbWRSU0FycGF6NzV5aVFTSzZtZ3BpcHRRaEFwYmZzQzJBbnNLNi05WUMzV2tEMGk4enBnZ3JLa2N1SWhOQzFRZHBDSWlMMHY3UGlhOUdYM2t2VExraFhLUVF3SzZIc3ZqX1lhWmFDTWowV0tWWXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxPTVNaYUNMb2hEZjU0cUdxczIxSjI1bE91LUhrOUxPMENCeVVrZ0xPUDBOak1MWDk1RUtFVDdzOTY5akxTZTRMeUg3ZXNGRTVzSktyT19vX2ZqcDB5dG5IeklRMENsMzJ4ZWhVVWZWNEI0cHdJSUxEVmo4WEVvV0VtTFg4NC1OU0t3MzNNMg?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQN2paVnhpUmQ2QmViay1yanBjRGxxbHNnRDFJakdzdURYak9lT0V2bjEya2hnRVBqc20tbGtCWHdVZXdSc0d5czFiVS1mMi1oVjZieU1kV182VGlSZXRkLWx4Qjk1MUl4OVhWRG5GazJoMFp0T3FSZXE0RlpJZkdzd3JvY29NWm53UEZ1ZHBjVmJQdENtd28ySXlCSWdBNlhfNmUwUjQ4aw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFB